{"id": "EUVD-2026-108885", "enisaUuid": "22fac072-7053-3c8b-9b7c-43d7818c9cfa", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\novl: fix UAF in ovl_do_mkdir() debug print\n\novl_do_mkdir() prints the input dentry with %pd after vfs_mkdir().\nSince commit fe497f0759e0 (\"VFS: change vfs_mkdir() to unlock on\nfailure.\"), vfs_mkdir() calls end_creating() on the input dentry on\nfailure and may replace it on success, so the post-call %pd can\nuse-after-free the dentry when CONFIG_OVERLAY_FS_DEBUG is enabled.\n\nPrint the dentry before the call and only the result afterward.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:02:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:05:33", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/719bd33ab359c539a68a278c15a97deb77565cdb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae146bc1abdeb4607abf2975b858c053024e8ac1"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98921"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5d577e46-6ffa-30ad-b45f-fda1269e80b2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fe497f0759e0efb949f9480911d00b6045c21f50 <ae146bc1abdeb4607abf2975b858c053024e8ac1"}, {"id": "5fcb688f-06c4-33ca-a109-88a795fde98d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "83188b75-3490-3dde-9dea-41063d5cae3a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.9"}, {"id": "9fdcd68f-5f3d-3313-8999-5235ef0b4bbc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "d3111e02-321b-3a93-b430-541aa6062116", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fe497f0759e0efb949f9480911d00b6045c21f50 <719bd33ab359c539a68a278c15a97deb77565cdb"}, {"id": "fa659d65-b280-38f7-97d1-e3ba565232e9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.19"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e5b31629-5fe3-38b7-9ddc-80f0